; =============================================================================
; GIAM-SAT Windows Advanced Audit Policy baseline (SEC review Phase 2)
; Import into a GPO: Computer Configuration > Windows Settings > Security
; Settings > right-click "Security Settings" > Import Policy -> select this INF.
; GUID-based entries are locale-independent (works on any Windows language).
;
; NOTE: this INF only sets the audit categories. The lsass.exe SACL + PowerShell
; Script Block Logging still need enable_windows_audit.ps1 (or GPP registry
; preferences): Computer Config > Preferences > Windows Settings > Registry.
; =============================================================================
